eon%27s%20coup%20d%27%C3%A9tat","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=French%20Second%20Empire%20proclaimed"]},{"from":"t68-924e52cbdc8c","to":"t68-e1eb048bd967","label":"Military defeat ended Napoleon III's regime","type":"development","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=French%20Second%20Empire%20proclaimed","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Franco-Prussian%20War"]},{"from":"t68-e1eb048bd967","to":"t68-2e6bb2929b4a","label":"A decisive battle within the war","type":"event","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Franco-Prussian%20War","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Battle%20of%20Sedan"]},{"from":"t68-e1eb048bd967","to":"t68-28b78178f2b2","label":"War and victory accelerated German unification","type":"development","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Franco-Prussian%20War","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proclamation_of_the_German_Empire"]},{"from":"t68-e1eb048bd967","to":"t68-d781d2f7abff","label":"Defeat and political crisis preceded the Commune","type":"background","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Franco-Prussian%20War","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Paris%20Commune"]},{"from":"t68-e1eb048bd967","to":"t68-de54a6dde3f4","label":"Peace settlement after the war","type":"settlement","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Franco-Prussian%20War","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Treaty%20of%20Frankfurt"]},{"from":"t68-26223a60f60e","to":"t68-28b78178f2b2","label":"Prussian ascendancy preceded unification without Austria","type":"development","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Austro-Prussian%20War","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proclamation_of_the_German_Empire"]},{"from":"t68-26223a60f60e","to":"t68-b4214650024c","label":"Austrian defeat preceded internal constitutional restructuring","type":"background","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Austro-Prussian%