ly battle on the Western Front","type":"event","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=First%20Battle%20of%20the%20Marne"]},{"from":"t68-3b66dca6d225","to":"t68-7c2e152df39f","label":"Major early battle on the Eastern Front","type":"event","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Battle%20of%20Tannenberg"]},{"from":"t68-3b66dca6d225","to":"t68-90266f628f28","label":"Secret diplomacy preceded Italian entry","type":"event","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Treaty%20of%20London"]},{"from":"t68-3b66dca6d225","to":"t68-fc58ae0e61bc","label":"War intensified economic and political pressures","type":"background","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Russian%20February%20and%20October%20Revolutions"]},{"from":"t68-fc58ae0e61bc","to":"t68-683799ff4039","label":"The USSR was founded five years after the revolutions","type":"development","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Russian%20February%20and%20October%20Revolutions","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Soviet%20Union%20founded"]},{"from":"t68-3b66dca6d225","to":"t68-9cb6fe7c4591","label":"Armistice ended fighting with Germany, not all postwar conflicts","type":"event","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_I","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Armistice%20of%2011%20November"]},{"from":"t68-9cb6fe7c4591","to":"t68-de0ef9a9ea79","label":"Peace negotiations followed the armistice","type":"sequence","references":["https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Armistice%20of%2011%20November","https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Paris%20Peace%20Conference"]},{"from":"t68-de0ef9a9ea79","to":"t68-d7be04437461","label":"German treaty negotiated within the wider conference","type":"settlement","references":["https: